      "evidence_char_start": 83,
      "evidence_char_end": 322,
      "evidence_text": "Metoprolol is a beta-blocker medication used to treat high blood pressure, chest pain (angina), and heart failure, and to improve survival after a heart attack. It works mainly on the heart, so it is called a cardioselective beta-blocker.\n",
